{{!
    @template local_eventcalendar/publish_dialog

    Dialog with the options to publish a calendar. Each option shows a preview on top and the button
    to copy its code (or its image, for the QR code) below. Opened from the calendar management page
    by the local_eventcalendar/publish_dialog module.

    A native HTML dialog element is used: opened with showModal() it is a modal dialog with focus
    management and Escape key support in every Moodle version, without depending on the core modal
    API, which changed between Moodle 4.1 and 5.x. The dialog has no padding and the content is in an
    inner element, so that a click on the dialog element itself is a click on the backdrop.

    The options are a carousel that follows the WAI-ARIA carousel pattern: no automatic rotation,
    previous and next buttons, a status text announced to screen readers and one group per option
    ("slide"). The JavaScript shows up to three options at a time and hides the others with the hidden
    attribute; without JavaScript all options are visible. The previews are inert: they show the result
    but their links cannot be followed or focused. The image copy button copies the image of the preview
    of its option, so the data URI of the QR code is not repeated in the page. The optional link of an
    option (theme settings) opens in a new window, so that the dialog stays available; its icon tells
    it to screen reader users too.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id - Unique id of the dialog
    * title - Dialog title
    * snippets - Options, each with key, title, description, slidelabel, preview, and code (text to copy)
      or image and filename (image to copy), and an optional link with url and label

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "local-eventcalendar-publish-1",
        "title": "Publish the calendar: Advent",
        "snippets": [
            {"key": "link", "title": "Link", "description": "A text link.", "slidelabel": "1 of 2",
             "preview": "<a href=\"#\">Advent</a>", "code": "<a href=\"#\">Advent</a>"},
            {"key": "menu", "title": "Theme menu item", "description": "A line for the menu.", "slidelabel": "2 of 2",
             "preview": "<code>Advent|/local/eventcalendar/view.php?id=1</code>",
             "code": "Advent|/local/eventcalendar/view.php?id=1",
             "link": {"url": "#", "label": "Open the menu settings"}
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<dialog id="{{id}}" class="local-eventcalendar-publish" aria-labelledby="{{id}}-title">
<div class="local-eventcalendar-publish-body">
    <div class="d-flex align-items-start mb-2">
        <h2 id="{{id}}-title" class="h4 mb-0">{{title}}</h2>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link p-0 local-eventcalendar-push-end" data-action="local-eventcalendar-publish-close"
                title="{{#str}}closebuttontitle, core{{/str}}">
            {{#pix}}e/cancel, core, {{#str}}closebuttontitle, core{{/str}}{{/pix}}
        </button>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted">{{#str}}publishintro, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}</p>
    <div class="local-eventcalendar-publish-carousel" role="region" aria-roledescription="{{#str}}publishcarousel, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}"
            aria-label="{{#str}}publishoptions, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}" data-region="carousel">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2 local-eventcalendar-gap-sm">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="local-eventcalendar-publish-previous"
                    aria-controls="{{id}}-options" hidden>
                <span aria-hidden="true">&lsaquo;</span> {{#str}}publishprevious, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}
            </button>
            <span data-region="carousel-status" aria-live="polite"></span>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-action="local-eventcalendar-publish-next"
                    aria-controls="{{id}}-options" hidden>
                {{#str}}publishnext, local_eventcalendar{{/str}} <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div id="{{id}}-options" class="local-eventcalendar-publish-options" data-region="options">
            {{#snippets}}
            <div class="local-eventcalendar-publish-option card" role="group" aria-roledescription="{{#str}}publishslide, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}"
                    aria-labelledby="{{id}}-{{key}}" aria-describedby="{{id}}-{{key}}-position" data-region="slide">
                <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
                    <h3 id="{{id}}-{{key}}" class="h6 mb-1">{{title}}</h3>
                    <span id="{{id}}-{{key}}-position" class="accesshide">{{slidelabel}}</span>
                    <p class="small text-muted">{{description}}</p>
                    <div class="local-eventcalendar-publish-preview mb-3" inert>
                        {{#image}}<img src="{{image}}" alt="" class="local-eventcalendar-publish-qrcode">{{/image}}
                        {{^image}}{{{preview}}}{{/image}}
                    </div>
                    {{#code}}
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary mt-auto" data-action="local-eventcalendar-publish-copy"
                            data-code="{{code}}">{{#str}}copycode, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}</button>
                    {{/code}}
                    {{#image}}
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary mt-auto" data-action="local-eventcalendar-publish-copy-image">
                        {{#str}}copyimage, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}
                    </button>
                    <a href="{{image}}" download="{{filename}}" class="mt-2 small text-center">{{#str}}downloadimage, local_eventcalendar{{/str}}</a>
                    {{/image}}
                    {{#link}}
                    <a href="{{url}}" class="mt-2 small text-center" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                        {{label}} {{#pix}}i/externallink, core, {{#str}}opensinnewwindow, core{{/str}}{{/pix}}
                    </a>
                    {{/link}}
                </div>
            </div>
            {{/snippets}}
        </div>
    </div>
    <span class="accesshide" role="status" data-region="status"></span>
</div>
</dialog>
